# A small glass of water (1.2.0), for a drink break. Drawn for a duck facing right (duck frame
# idle): `cup` held, `cup-sip` tipped into the beak. The glass is flat light tints (no partial
# alpha): an empty pale top, the water darker towards the bottom right.
name: water-cup
size: 7x7
palette:
  K #2a1f2d
  W #ffffff
  g #e2f4fc
  b #bfe6f5
  B #6cc0ec
  D #3f8fcf

@frame cup
.K....K
.KWgggK
.KbbbbK
.KWBBDK
.KWBBDK
..KBDK.
..KKKK.

@frame cup-sip
..KK...
.KbbK..
KbBBBK.
.KBBDWK
..KDggK
...KgK.
....K..
